{"id":"rai_z","lemma":"raíz","pos":"noun","rank":2728,"glosses":["root; root vegetable","root (of a tooth, a nail, etc)","root"],"ipa":"/raˈiθ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"raíces"},"order":2734,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/27/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodrigo5260-ra%C3%ADz.wav","examples":[{"text":"El dinero es la raíz de todos los males.","en":"Money is the root of all evil.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/538050","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"money"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"badly, poorly, ill","l":"mal"}]},{"text":"La raíz cuadrada de cuatro es dos.","en":"The square root of 4 is 2.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"square","l":"cuadrado"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a four-stringed guitar…"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"dung, excrement"}]},{"text":"La pobreza es la raíz de todo mal.","en":"Poverty is the root of all evil.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"poverty"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null,{"g":"badly, poorly, ill"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"all kinds of things"]]}]}